00:23:20,334 --> 00:23:25,952
So I've given it my goal, I've given it the context, and now I have to give it the action, one of the most important parts.

300
00:23:26,112 --> 00:23:31,632
I say, I want you to analyze my past video stats from my channel, then research my niche.

